{"version":1,"key":"card:631","content":{"id":631,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"padStart","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在字符串的前面填充指定字符以满足指定的长度要求，接收两个参数："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目标长度"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"填充字符串，可选，默认为空格 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"\" \"(U+0020)","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const month = （new Date().getMonth() + 1） // -> 9\nconst formattedMonth = month.padStart(2, \"0\") // -> 09","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b3d76a49-4a32-4f28-bdf3-682667ef6f7a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果本身的长度已经大于或等于指定的长度，则直接返回原值"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const str = \"Hello World!\"\nconst padStr = str.padStart(10, \" \") // -> Hello World!","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a9874e85-8896-41e7-9c31-ff25cb84d1c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二个参数不仅仅可以是单个字符，还可以是字符串，当指定为字符串时会循环字符串填充，直至满足长度要求，这个填充的字符串是可以被截断的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const str = \"JavaScript\"\nconst fs1 = str.padStart(15, \"->\") // ->->-JavaScript","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"794ed1be-2a43-4f2a-b9f6-2768381d4737","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果第二个参数指定的不是字符串，如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"boolean","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这些值，那么会被转化为字符串，然后作为填充字符"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const str = \"JavaScript\"\n\nstr.padStart(15, false) // falseJavaScript\nstr.padStart(15, true)  // truetJavaScript\nstr.padStart(15, null)  // nullnJavaScript\nstr.padStart(15, {})    // [objeJavaScript","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"83a1924b-b97c-4a1b-af15-3b7142e581d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"padEnd","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在字符串的后面填充指定字符以满足指定长度要求，同样接收两个参数："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目标长度"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"填充字符串，可选，默认为空格 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"\" \"(U+0020)","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"用法及注意事项同 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"padStart","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一致"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const str = \"JavaScript\"\n\nstr.padEnd(8, \"0\")   // JavaScript (指定长度小于原字符长度，直接返回)\n\nstr.padEnd(15)       // JavaScript_____ (使用 _ 来表示空格)\nstr.padEnd(15, \"->\") // JavaScript->->-\nstr.padEnd(15, true) // JavaScripttruet\nstr.padEnd(15, \".\")  // JavaScript.....","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"37e45fa2-667a-42de-8f03-f6c78c2d610c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/String/padStart","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"String.prototype.padStart()"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/String/padEnd","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"String.prototype.padEnd()"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.zhangxinxu.com/wordpress/2018/07/js-padstart-padend/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JS字符串补全方法padStart()和padEnd()简介"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/字符串"],"createTime":1758811015438,"updateTime":1758812156619,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1758812156619}}